            "detailed_description": "A ninja survival game where you wage combat in an expansive diorama landscape. Defeat hordes of enemies using shuriken throwing stars!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIncrease your score by effectively utilizing hanabi (homing explosives), katon (fire breath), and explosive fuda (land mines).<br />\r\nBecome more powerful by defeating enemies and ranking up.<br />\r\nRestore life with sushi.<br />\r\nRamp up the fight with two powerful items: bunshin-no-jutsu and gama.<br />\r\nPlay with others online.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith the ability to choose from five graphic settings, you can even play on your laptop.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*1 map only (1 map and 19stages)",
